# --target=linux_k1om: the k1om toolchain and runtime, the gcc backend (scripts/nfcxx-k1om-env.rb plan, restructure step 3).
# --target=NAME: the EDG table, the target's options and EDG_CPFE_DEFAULT_OPTIONS (scripts/nfcxx-target.rb plan, restructure step 3).
